## Model card

- **Name:** Exo Free
- **Short description:** An unidentified vendor's free OpenCode Zen stealth slot (Oct 2026) — 1M context, image input, reasoning and tool calling — that lived roughly three days and is now deprecated (HTTP 410). Vendor never disclosed; no model card.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `opencode/exo-free` (`https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/chat/completions`, `@ai-sdk/openai-compatible`); free during the preview window. Retired slot — the id no longer resolves.
- **Release / knowledge:** Appeared 2026-10-06; gone by ~2026-10-09 (HTTP 410 ModelDeprecated); knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `exo-free` (Zen, retired).
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 (1M) total; 131,072 max output (Zen docs / Sulat registry).
- **Modalities:** text, image in; text out. Reasoning, tool calling, attachments.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-21):** Free ($0/$0/$0) during the limited preview; now deprecated.
- **Architecture:** undisclosed (stealth).

